# NOTICE — Lexicon Data Provenance & Attributions

Ratchet bundles an offline, zero-network pre-indexed Radix-Trie lexicon for named entity detection (`src/detectors/gazetteer-data.json`, 22.5 KB).

---

## 1. Data Provenance & Category Counts

The bundled gazetteer contains a total of **524 hand-curated seed entries** across four categories:

| Category | Entry Count | Provenance & Selection Method |
| :--- | :---: | :--- |
| **First Names** (`FIRST_NAME`) | **159** | Hand-curated list of common given names across South Asian, Middle Eastern, East Asian, African, and Western demographics. |
| **Last Names** (`LAST_NAME`) | **149** | Hand-curated list of common surnames across South Asian, Middle Eastern, East Asian, African, and Western demographics. |
| **Organizations** (`ORG`) | **99** | Hand-curated list of prominent technology firms, financial institutions, consulting firms, research universities, and multilateral agencies. |
| **Locations** (`LOCATION`) | **117** | Hand-curated list of major sovereign nations and global metropolitan tech/commercial hubs. |

**Clarification on External Corpora:**
Earlier project documentation referenced bulk external datasets (US Census Bureau, GeoNames, Natural Earth, SEC EDGAR, and Wikidata). No automated bulk ingestion or dataset downloads were performed for this bundle. All entries were assembled directly by hand in `scripts/build-trie.mjs` to keep the extension footprint small (~22.5 KB JSON, ~4.5 MB in-memory heap) and preserve zero-network operation.

